@startuml
title MW-01 - Sign In and Profile Setup

start
:Open the landing page;
:Click "Sign in";
:Choose Google sign-in or enter email and password;

:Validate the sign-in credentials;

if (Sign-in successful?) then (Yes)
  :Issue access token;
  :Persist the session;
else (No)
  :Return an error message;
  :Re-enter the credentials;
  :Validate the sign-in credentials;
  if (Sign-in successful?) then (Yes)
    :Issue access token;
    :Persist the session;
  else (No)
    :Return an error message;
    stop
  endif
endif

if (Profile already set up?) then (No)
  :Select role, sectors and goals;
  :Save the personal profile;
else (Yes)
endif

:Enter the workspace;

stop
@enduml
